{
  "description": "delegation scope check (SPEC §7.3, REGISTRY.md §4): for each case, whether the pledge satisfies a pledge:create scope in the delegation, and the first scope that does. A key, operator or value the verifier does not recognise fails the check; max_bond_sats is a ceiling on bond.min_sats, read from <= or the earlier =, as a decimal integer of at most 2^53 - 1; counterparty=null means no counterparty. A failed check is E_DELEGATION_SCOPE_VIOLATED.",
  "kind": "scope-check",
  "inputs": {
    "cases": [
      {
        "note": "bare scope",
        "pledge": {
          "bond": {
            "min_sats": 1000
          },
          "resolution": {
            "mechanism": "chain_state"
          },
          "counterparty": null
        },
        "scopes": [
          "pledge:create"
        ]
      },
      {
        "note": "empty parentheses",
        "pledge": {
          "bond": {
            "min_sats": 1000
